  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "At STP\nTemperature, $T=273 \\mathrm{~K}$\nMolecular mass of oxygen, $\\mathrm{M}=32 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{~kg}$\nSpeed of sound is given by\n$\\mathrm{v}=\\sqrt{\\frac{\\gamma \\mathrm{RT}}{\\mathrm{M}}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{1.4 \\times 8.3 \\times 273}{32 \\times 10^{-3}}}$\n$=314.8541 \\simeq 315 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$",
    "image": null
  },
